      "content": "that sounds like a solid plan for the staff. one more thing—sometimes these things get weird when the kitchen is under pressure and things start going missing or being used incorrectly, like someone using the wrong tongs or a specific ingredient being misplaced. what's the best way to prevent that kind of \"unexplained\" chaos from happening in the middle of the rush?",
      "source": "evaluator"
